      "text": "sandbox-\npod",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "wD6-hJ2Bo6fbcJZum8Ub0",
      "originalText": "sandbox-pod",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gOtN9UqXqqJlunsp3iunO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1319.7256599258264,
      "y": 157.95210227234833,
      "width": 562.069172188013,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 997380328,
      "version": 190,
      "versionNonce": 884047256,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778993051665,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. SandboxKit creates JobPODTemplate + ConfigMap\n(with labels already in the Job’s pod template).\n\n\n2. API server stores them in etcd.\n\n3. Job controller watches Jobs; when it sees a new one,\nit creates a Pod from job.spec.template (your labels are\nalready in that template).\n\n\n4. Scheduler assigns the Pod to a node.\n\n\n5. Kubelet on that node starts the container.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. SandboxKit creates JobPODTemplate + ConfigMap (with labels already in the Job’s pod template).\n\n\n2. API server stores them in etcd.\n\n3. Job controller watches Jobs; when it sees a new one, it creates a Pod from job.spec.template (your labels are already in that template).\n\n\n4. Scheduler assigns the Pod to a node.\n\n\n5. Kubelet on that node starts the container.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WOtvZUPsOwix421TVb8qh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1386.5010337501403,
      "y": -373.0500437645686,
      "width": 767.6596069335938,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ae",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 282453992,
      "version": 122,
      "versionNonce": 1567153560,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778992291798,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "sandbox_id = sandbox-abc123\n\nConfigMap:  name = code-sandbox-abc123\n            labels: sandbox-id=sandbox-abc123\n            data: code.py = user's actual_code\n\nJob:        name = sandbox-abc123\n            labels: sandbox-id=sandbox-abc123\n            spec.template:\n              labels: sandbox-id=sandbox-abc123\n              volumes: configMap → code-sandbox-abc123 mounted at /sandbox/\n\nPod:        name = sandbox-abc123-<random>   (created by Job controller)\n            labels: sandbox-id=..., job-name=sandbox-abc123, ...\n            (kubelet runs this on a worker)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "sandbox_id = sandbox-abc123\n\nConfigMap:  name = code-sandbox-abc123\n            labels: sandbox-id=sandbox-abc123\n            data: code.py = user's actual_code\n\nJob:        name = sandbox-abc123\n            labels: sandbox-id=sandbox-abc123\n            spec.template:\n              labels: sandbox-id=sandbox-abc123\n              volumes: configMap → code-sandbox-abc123 mounted at /sandbox/\n\nPod:        name = sandbox-abc123-<random>   (created by Job controller)\n            labels: sandbox-id=..., job-name=sandbox-abc123, ...\n            (kubelet runs this on a worker)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5BxTo1wiES0vQMmo4LubC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1976.0731360193909,
      "y": 165.5243952892264,
      "width": 841.6101207158388,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "af",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1831775640,
      "version": 248,
      "versionNonce": 1500449176,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778992888156,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- How does the JobPoDtemplate and ConfigMap \nStores?\nPOST body: sandbox_template + actual_code\n              |\n              v\n\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────\n───────────────────────────────────┐\n│ SandboxKit (in memory + settings)                                         │\n│                                                                            │\n│   sandboxkit-py-template → image: sandboxkit-sandboxkit-py-template:local        │\n│                         file_extension: py                                │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────\n───────────────────────────────────┘\n              |\n              |\n      ┌───────┴────────┐\n      v                v\n\nConfigMap          Job (Pod template)\n---------          ------------------\n\nname: code-sandbox-…        containers[0]:\ndata:                       image: sandboxkit-sandboxkit-py-template:local  ← TEMPLATE\nHERE\n  code.py: \"from            imagePullPolicy: Never\n  fastapi...\"               entrypoint: python /sandbox/code.py  (in image)\n                            volumeMounts:\nlabels:                       - /sandbox  ← from ConfigMap below\n  sandbox-id=…              volumes:\n                              - configMap: code-sandbox-abc123\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- How does the JobPoDtemplate and ConfigMap \nStores?\nPOST body: sandbox_template + actual_code\n              |\n              v\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ SandboxKit (in memory + settings)                                         │\n│                                                                            │\n│   sandboxkit-py-template → image: sandboxkit-sandboxkit-py-template:local        │\n│                         file_extension: py                                │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n              |\n              |\n      ┌───────┴────────┐\n      v                v\n\nConfigMap          Job (Pod template)\n---------          ------------------\n\nname: code-sandbox-…        containers[0]:\ndata:                       image: sandboxkit-sandboxkit-py-template:local  ← TEMPLATE HERE\n  code.py: \"from            imagePullPolicy: Never\n  fastapi...\"               entrypoint: python /sandbox/code.py  (in image)\n                            volumeMounts:\nlabels:                       - /sandbox  ← from ConfigMap below\n  sandbox-id=…              volumes:\n                              - configMap: code-sandbox-abc123\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
